# Requires review for the protected paths in rules/protected-paths.yaml. Do NOT
# hardcode a path here on its own, separate from that rule file — the list
# below must be a 1-to-1 mirror of the `paths` field in
# rules/protected-paths.yaml (this does not include `escalate_paths`, which
# only needs runtime confirmation, not a required CODEOWNERS review).
# `lint_codeowners()` in scripts/validate.py checks the reverse direction
# every time `make validate` runs — if you edit a protected path, edit
# protected-paths.yaml first, then add the matching line here; if one side is
# missing, `make validate` fails.
#
# TODO: replace @gft-harness-maintainers with a real GitHub team/user once
# this repo is hosted under a specific GitHub org.

/rules/                        @gft-harness-maintainers
/hooks/                        @gft-harness-maintainers
/registry/                     @gft-harness-maintainers
/.claude-plugin/               @gft-harness-maintainers
agents/*/manifest.yaml         @gft-harness-maintainers
skills/*/manifest.yaml         @gft-harness-maintainers
